cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Scriptavera in preparing a paper, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scriptavera: faithful conversion of handwritten research notes into papers"
abstract: "Scriptavera turns handwritten research notes into a LaTeX research paper in many small, checked steps, with the author confirming the notation, every doubtful reading and every figure, and a mechanical audit that the mathematics reaches the paper unchanged."
authors:
